<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 220-5 AT TEA V ZIMBABWE IN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 220-5 AT TEA V ZIMBABWE IN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 220 for five wickets at tea in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings total of 141 on the second day of the second cricket test on Thursday.</p>
</text>
